{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/national-treatment-of-conformity-assessment-bodies-ntcabs-with-india","content_id":"4bb70148-a656-4dbb-91ab-bd1f42ee0ff5","description":"How the NTCABs process ensures UK and India conformity assessment bodies (CABs) are treated equally.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9409250","isbn":"","title":"National treatment of conformity assessment bodies (NTCABs) with India","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/publications/national-treatment-of-conformity-assessment-bodies-ntcabs-with-india/national-treatment-of-conformity-assessment-bodies-ntcabs-with-india"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>UK conformity assessment bodies (<abbr title=\"conformity assessment bodies\">CABs</abbr>) can now apply for accreditation, approval or licensing to conformity assess goods against India’s regulations in certain sectors.</p>\n\n<p>These sectors are:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>measuring instruments</li>\n  <li>non-automatic weighing instruments</li>\n  <li>equipment for potentially explosive atmospheres</li>\n  <li>pressure equipment</li>\n  <li>lifts</li>\n  <li>simple pressure vessels</li>\n  <li>appliances burning gaseous fuels</li>\n  <li>pyrotechnics</li>\n  <li>recreational craft</li>\n  <li>noise emissions</li>\n  <li>personal protective equipment</li>\n  <li>machinery</li>\n  <li>electromagnetic compatibility</li>\n  <li>toys</li>\n  <li>radio equipment</li>\n  <li>sporting products (including cricket equipment)</li>\n  <li>textiles</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>To do this, UK <abbr title=\"conformity assessment bodies\">CABs</abbr> will need to apply for accreditation from India’s relevant accreditation body.</p>\n\n<p>Should the application be approved, this will allow the <abbr title=\"conformity assessment body\">CAB</abbr> to assess against India’s regulations in the UK.</p>\n\n<p>This could save time and money for businesses as goods would no longer need to be sent to the other country for assessing.</p>\n\n<p>This process is referred to as national treatment of conformity assessment bodies (<abbr title=\"national treatment of conformity assessment bodies\">NTCABs</abbr>) under the terms of the comprehensive economic and trade agreement (<abbr title=\"comprehensive economic and trade agreement\">CETA</abbr>). It ensures that <abbr title=\"conformity assessment bodies\">CABs</abbr> from the UK and India respectively be treated on the same terms as or in an equivalent way to domestic <abbr title=\"conformity assessment bodies\">CABs</abbr>.</p>\n\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-15T14:03:00Z"}],"document_type_label":"Guidance","emphasised_organisations":["d62ba2be-4ae5-4a9c-ac19-7c1dd197deea","aa750cdf-7925-429d-a2b3-0d9fa47d2c48"],"featured_attachments":["9409250"],"first_public_at":"2026-07-15T15:03:00.000+01:00","national_applicability":{"england":{"applicable":true,"label":"England"},"northern_ireland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Northern Ireland"},"scotland":{"applicable":true,"label":"Scotland"},"wales":{"applicable":true,"label":"Wales"}},"political":false,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"guidance","first_published_at":"2026-07-15T15:03:00+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/national-treatment-of-conformity-assessment-bodies-ntcabs-with-india","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications/national-treatment-of-conformity-assessment-bodies-ntcabs-with-india","base_path":"/government/publications/national-treatment-of-conformity-assessment-bodies-ntcabs-with-india","content_id":"4bb70148-a656-4dbb-91ab-bd1f42ee0ff5","document_type":"guidance","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-07-15T14:03:00Z","schema_name":"publication","title":"National treatment of conformity assessme